WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:03.760 line:85%
It’s 2052.

2
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:07.890 line:85%
Far below the clouds, the Earth is resting
and slowly getting better.

3
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:13.650 line:85%
Up here, the islands of the Lumen shelf look after
what was saved, until it can go home.

4
00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:16.960 line:85%
Cell 7 is the furthest island out.

5
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:21.490 line:85%
Just wet rock, one clump of grass,
and a hawthorn hedge.

6
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:25.250 line:85%
I’m Maris. I keep the shelf’s records.

7
00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:28.960 line:85%
I’m sending you one earthworm
and one bumblebee.

8
00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.960 line:85%
That’s all we can spare.

9
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:36.100 line:85%
If they’re both still with you tonight,
I get to write a word on Cell 7’s page.

10
00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:37.520 line:85%
It’s never had one.

11
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.550 line:85%
Plant this island, keeper.

12
00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:41.360 line:85%
I’ll write down what stays.
